{"id":"ones-and-zeroes","title":"Ones and zeroes","difficulty":"medium","pattern":"two-dimensional knapsack","statement":"<p>Choose the largest number of strings from the list such that, in total, they contain at most m zeros and at most n ones.</p>","entry":{"python":"find_max_form","cpp":{"name":"findMaxForm","ret":"int","params":[["vector<string>","strs"],["int","m"],["int","n"]]}},"kind":"function","compare":"exact","time_limit_ms":2000,"hints":["Each string is an item with two weights (zeros, ones) and value 1.","0/1 knapsack with a 2-D capacity; iterate both capacities downward."],"complexity":"O(len(strs) \u00d7 m \u00d7 n)","starter":{"python":"def find_max_form(strs, m, n):\n    pass\n","cpp":"int findMaxForm(vector<string>& strs, int m, int n) {\n    \n}\n"},"tests":[{"args":[["10","0001","111001","1","0"],5,3],"expected":4,"sample":true},{"args":[["10","0","1"],1,1],"expected":2,"sample":true},{"args":[["111"],1,1],"expected":0},{"args":[["10","111011","0101","100","000","01010010","001","100000","0101","1","10000","01011","0010101","0010100","11100","10001","01","1","1","00101110","11001111","010111","01","101001","100","11001110","0","10111","0001110","1111","01","010","11","100","0101110","11010111","1110101","1111","0","11","01","111","11110","0110010","10","000","11001000","00","10010","1","1100","1011100","0","00","1001","0100","0110","000101","10101","01100","001","111","10010","10100","1011","01001","0101","0100","110","11101101","100111","11010","00","10111010","01","100","101110","1011110","10110000","0110","010111","1010","10010","1001","00","11000011","1001110","10011","01110","011101","1","00000","01","1100101","0110","01110000","10","1101001","0","11110110"],30,40],"expected":33},{"args":[["1100100","01001010","11","0","11","111","0","0111010","100","0","0110","1111","11110","11100011","111101","1","0000","111111","10001010","111","0100","100","0","10","1101101","1","0111","110011","0010","11101010","001","11","100","11010","010","01010","0100100","00101111","1101000","111","00111","0000","011","00","110","0011","111","00111101","0010","01000","01000","1001","10","01","00100001","101100","0001","101100","110011","111","010","01","01011","001011","1000","01101100","11","00111111","1","0111","01000100","011","10","0010111","10","11010","011","00001","011111","01101101","100110","001","0","01100","0010","111111","1110010","11","1111111","1","10","0","0001","111100","01101","10110","0000","0","0001","11","111110","000","0011","0","11","01001","10001","1000","010","1110110","0","11111","000010","011010","0","101","1101011","10000","01","11","111000","010010","100","00","100010","10100101","1110","01","01","111101","11","001010","011100","1","00","0011","01101","1","10110","10","11","000","0011","11001111","0","1000110","0011101","001","0","01","1110","0101","00","11","001101","1111","011","010","10001","0000001","101","110","1","0000","1110100","001001","011101","0","000","1110","1101000","011","110001","10000000","1","110","1100","101","1100","1","1101111","1","1","101","00111","111000","0010001","10110010","1","00011011","100","0","11","111","11011","1101","1101001","0101","0011100","11","01","101110","01","001101","110","0100011","1101","01101001","1011111","0","1100110","101001","1101111","0100000","1110010","001001","10111","101","0","0","100","0100","1100","00111000","10101","101000","1","10010","010110","1000","0","11011000","0","0011","100","100","0","0001010","00","10","00000","1","00000","110","01100","1000","01110","1010011","1010101","01","0101","0100100","00","0000100","1","000001","0","1","001","001011","11011","0010110","000","11110","001111","0001010","01001111","1011","010","0111101","100","1","11000001","10001111","10101","000","110","1","1100111","101001","0110","0110","0110001","10101","01111","11","110110","1","110011","11111","1010111","10111001","0001111","111101","1001001","0101","110010","0101100","1001","1010001"],60,60],"expected":78}],"solution":{"explanation":"<p>Recognising the knapsack shape: <em>items</em>, <em>capacities</em>, choose each at most once, maximise a value. Two capacities just add a dimension to dp, both iterated downward for 0/1 semantics.</p>","python":"def find_max_form(strs, m, n):\n    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]\n    for s in strs:\n        z, o = s.count(\"0\"), s.count(\"1\")\n        for i in range(m, z - 1, -1):\n            for j in range(n, o - 1, -1):\n                if dp[i - z][j - o] + 1 > dp[i][j]: dp[i][j] = dp[i - z][j - o] + 1\n    return dp[m][n]\n","cpp":"int findMaxForm(vector<string>& strs, int m, int n) {\n    vector<vector<int>> dp(m + 1, vector<int>(n + 1, 0));\n    for (auto& s : strs) { int z = count(s.begin(), s.end(), '0'), o = s.size() - z;\n        for (int i = m; i >= z; i--) for (int j = n; j >= o; j--) dp[i][j] = max(dp[i][j], dp[i - z][j - o] + 1); }\n    return dp[m][n];\n}\n"}}